      "id": "the-revision-loop",
      "title": "PATTERN-006: The REVISION LOOP",
      "category": "Prompt Patterns",
      "description": "Nobody ships the first draft, and almost nobody revises one well, because the two default moves are hitting regenerate and typing \"make it better\". This is the loop that replaces them: diagnose before you prescribe, freeze what works before you fix what does not, borrow eyes that have never seen it, and stop on a condition you wrote down instead of on a feeling. 17 prompts and the decision tree for working out which move you are actually in.",
